 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Every time you apply for a public service,",
   "s": 0.3,
   "e": 2.94
  },
  {
   "text": "you may be asked for the same information again\u2026",
   "s": 2.94,
   "e": 5.813
  },
  {
   "text": "\u2026identity, address, income, documents \u2014",
   "s": 5.823,
   "e": 8.543
  },
  {
   "text": "over and over.",
   "s": 8.543,
   "e": 9.935
  },
  {
   "text": "DigiPae is exploring a consent-based",
   "s": 10.535,
   "e": 13.175
  },
  {
   "text": "connection layer for government data.",
   "s": 13.175,
   "e": 15.467
  },
  {
   "text": "You see what information is requested.",
   "s": 15.517,
   "e": 17.917
  },
  {
   "text": "You decide what can be shared.",
   "s": 17.917,
   "e": 19.978
  },
  {
   "text": "The vision is simple: verified information",
   "s": 20.078,
   "e": 22.718
  },
  {
   "text": "that can be reused when you choose \u2014",
   "s": 22.718,
   "e": 24.798
  },
  {
   "text": "instead of starting from zero every time.",
   "s": 24.798,
   "e": 27.713
  },
  {
   "text": "Eventually, that could mean retrieving the right record",
   "s": 27.763,
   "e": 30.483
  },
  {
   "text": "from the right source \u2014 with user permission.",
   "s": 30.483,
   "e": 33.361
  },
  {
   "text": "And helping people understand what programs",
   "s": 33.411,
   "e": 35.971
  },
  {
   "text": "may fit their situation \u2014",
   "s": 35.971,
   "e": 37.491
  },
  {
   "text": "and what they'll need before they apply.",
   "s": 37.491,
   "e": 39.947
  },
  {
   "text": "We're building toward infrastructure",
